      "id": "units-and-models"
    },
    "summary": "A unit’s **starting strength** is its number of models as battle round 1 begins; for an **attached unit**, that count includes every model in it.\n\nWhat a unit’s strength is called depends on that number:\n\n- At 2 or more, compare the models left with it: fewer is **below starting strength**, exactly half is **half-strength**, fewer than half is **below half-strength**.\n- At 1, compare the model’s remaining wounds with its W characteristic the same way.",
